OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,CToday:FA dry but grey start to the     
OL,6,Fday, rain moves in by late morning and 
OL,7,Fmay turn heavy at times. Windy across  
OL,8,Fall areas, but particularly strong     
OL,9,Falong the coast.                       
OL,11,CTonight:FRemaining cloudy and wet      
OL,12,Fduring the first half of the night,    
OL,13,Fbecoming dry and clear later.          
OL,14,FNoticeably less windy compared to      
OL,15,Fduring the day. Feeling cool as        
OL,16,Ftemperatures drop.                     
OL,18,CSunday:FBright and sunny for most of   
OL,19,Fthe day, with the wind strengthening a 
OL,20,Ftouch during the afternoon.            
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
