OL,3,GEast                                   
OL,5,COutlook for Monday to Wednesday:FThe   
OL,6,Ffirst half of the week will see some   
OL,7,Fwet and windy conditions for the most  
OL,8,Fpart, any drier interludes will be     
OL,9,Fshort-lived. Above average             
OL,10,Ftemperatures.                          
